WEBVTT

00:00:00.475 --> 00:00:03.338
¿Cómo dices: tengo muchas ganas de verte?

00:00:04.672 --> 00:00:05.821
See you on Saturday!

00:00:06.559 --> 00:00:08.033
I'm looking forward to seeing you.

00:00:09.747 --> 00:00:12.930
Después de look forward to, usa un verbo en -ing.

00:00:13.690 --> 00:00:14.575
Como seeing.

00:00:15.975 --> 00:00:18.860
O un sustantivo: I'm looking forward to the weekend.

00:00:20.854 --> 00:00:23.225
Ahora tú: I'm looking forward to…

00:00:23.865 --> 00:00:24.812
¿Cómo la completas?
